<title>USA: Enserch sees improved trend continuing.</title>
<headline>Enserch sees improved trend continuing.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enserch Exploration Inc said Monday it expects to see a trend of improved quarter-to- quarter results to continue.</p>
<p>The improvement is the result of efforts to cut its costs and to increase production volumes, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>For the second quarter, Enserch reported net income of $5.98 million, or $0.05 per share, on revenues of $72.39 million. In the prior year's second quarter, the company posted net income of $5.27 million, or $0.04 per share, on revenues of $84.04 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
